        <mxCell id="notes_box" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#a38812;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=10;fontColor=#a38812;dashed=1;strokeWidth=3;" value="System Design Classification &amp; Notes" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="380" width="6000" x="200" y="2750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes_text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=15;" value="▸ TYPE OF SYSTEM DESIGN:  Cloud-native multi-AZ web application on AWS  ·  Stateless containerised compute (ECS Fargate Auto-Scaling)  ·  Serverless DB (Aurora v2)     Edge proxy (Cloudflare) in front of regional ALB  ·  WAF-protected ingress  ·  VPC endpoints for private AWS-service access  ·  Centralised secrets + per-task IAM (least-privilege)     Observability via CloudWatch Logs + Alarms + SNS  ·  GitOps CI/CD (GitHub Actions → ECR → ECS rolling deploy)  ▸ NETWORK FLOW:  User → Cloudflare DNS → Cloudflare proxy (api.virfriendo.win) → WAF → ALB (multi-AZ) → ECS task (private subnet, 1 vCPU/4GB) → Aurora writer (private subnet, AZ-1a)                               ↳ ECS task → S3 (Gateway endpoint, presigned URL) / Secrets Manager (Interface endpoint) / CloudWatch Logs / ECR pull                               ↳ ECS task → NAT GW → IGW → Internet → external AI providers (Anthropic, Gemini, OpenAI, Deepgram, Replicate, Tavily, Groq)  ▸ HIGH AVAILABILITY:  ALB spans 2 AZs (1a + 1b)  ·  ECS Service distributes tasks across AZs  ·  Aurora Multi-AZ (writer in 1a, reader in 1b — auto-promoted on AZ failure)  ·  NAT GW per AZ  ▸ SECURITY:  Public access blocked on S3 (presigned URLs only)  ·  WAF blocks XSS/SQLi + 2000 req/IP/5min  ·  Aurora encrypted at rest  ·  Secrets in Secrets Manager (rotated)  ·  Tasks use VPC endpoints (no internet for AWS calls) ▸ COST:  Aurora Serverless v2 scales to 0.5 ACU when idle  ·  ECS Auto-Scaling 1–3 tasks  ·  ECR lifecycle keeps 2 revisions  ·  CloudWatch logs 30-day retention  ·  Old RDS db.t4g.micro stopped (pending delete)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="320" width="5920" x="240" y="2820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
